      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MOCAMBORA MITCH (2) produced a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 400m behind Divine Poppy (23.61) in a Grade 6. Worth another chance. LEGACY TO BURN (5) was popular in betting last start but disappointed when 11 lengths away in fourth (23.90). Finished second the start before. Has good box speed and can overcome the tricky draw. Expected to feature in the finish. BLACK STINGRAY (8) settled down midfield and held his position to the line when finishing 5th (17.47) at Murray Bridge Straight. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. BUSY EARNIN' (7) can fill a top-three spot.",
